The '''second matchday of the 2026 AFA World Cup''' was played on 16 June 2026 across venues in [[Balisca]] and [[Sanrobonia]]. The six group-stage fixtures produced 19 goals, highlighted by a dramatic draw between [[United Midlands national football team|United Midlands]] and [[Asikyira national football team|Asikyira]], a frantic late finish in [[Burawa national football team|Burawa]]'s match with [[Daras national football team|Daras]], and a split point between [[Aetolia national football team|Aetolia]] and [[Louyang national football team|Louyang]].

